    "title": "【2026Hackathon决赛】10：面向AI自驱优化的终端OS可观测性自适应增强框架",
    "content": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; color: black; background: white; line-height: 1.6;\">面向<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>自驱优化的终端<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>可观测性自适应增强框架</span></strong></span><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">二、背景信息：</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">随着<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>自驱优化<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>成为业界重要探索方向，通过构建<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>闭环（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI Loop</span>），自动完成<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>问题分析、优化决策与代码演进，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>可观测性成为支撑<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>自主优化的关键基础。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>需要能够自主识别现有观测信息无法区分的候选根因，发现关键可观测性缺口，并自动生成消除诊断歧义的观测机制，推动<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>优化从“黑盒调参”向“白盒自主优化”演进。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">当前鸿蒙系统<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">trace</span>和日志往往只能看到异常结果，缺少影响系统决策的关键条件和中间状态，难以准确复现系统决策路径，复杂问题仍依赖专家读代码、提出假设并人工补充可观测性打点。具体存在以下三个核心痛点：</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">1</span>）问题发生了，但现有可观测性打点<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DFX</span>信息无法解释“为什么”，只能看到最终结果，无法还原决策过程：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">例如，当一个因为<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">UX</span>界面交互的线程频繁被其他线程打断，仅从当前<strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">可观测性打点</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DFX</span>记录的调度优先级数值无法解释优先级低的原因是缺少关键线程识别标记、还是传递机制失效、还是不同调优策略之间相互冲突？又比如，看到应用内存占用量高，不清楚是哪个模块申请的内存量大，申请量是否合理。<strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">2</span>）补充可观测性打点高度依赖专家经验：当现有信息不足时，工程师需要阅读大量代码、构造可能的原因假设，再决定在哪些函数、变量和状态转换位置增加<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Trace</span>或日志。复杂系统框架和内核模块代码量巨大，这一过程耗时且依赖对模块机制的深入理解。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">3</span>）传统可观测性打点增强容易陷入“越加越多”：最直接的方案是在大量代码路径增加日志和<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Trace</span>，但过多埋点会增加运行时开销和数据量，甚至改变原始问题现场。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">三、问题描述：</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">大赛提供若干典型系统问题描述及日志<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/trace</span>等基础可观测性打点记录，能描述问题现场但无法直接定位到根因。参赛者需要<i>自备</i>能运行和调试<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OpenHarmony</span>（“开源鸿蒙“）系统的开发板（如<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DAYU200</span>），并准备好<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OpenHarmony</span>系统源码及构建环境（建议使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OpenHarmony 6.0 Release</span>）。参赛者需要现场完成“发现缺什么 → 找到在哪里补 → 自动生成补丁 → 重新运行 → 验证是否能够定位 → 有助于支撑系统优化”的问题根因分析闭环，并给出<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>可观测性自适应增强的系统框架原型。决赛阶段将给出具体要解决的观测解决赛题，参赛成果原型在解决这些观测问题的基础上，有潜力实现通用的可观测性高效自动增强能力。具体包括：</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">1</span>）可观测性缺口分析：根据问题现象、<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Trace/</span>日志和源码，识别无法区分的候选根因及缺失状态；</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">2</span>）观测打点位置与内容自动生成：自动定位需补充观测打点的函数、变量或决策分支，并生成可编译运行的补丁，并给出性能和计算开销评估；根据问题类型的不同，可能需要补充相应的观测机制；</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">3</span>）根因定位：利用新增信息，根据问题类型，将问题进一步定位到关键模块、执行路径或代码位置，并论证补充的信息有助于进一步实现<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>自驱演化；</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">该问题面临以下技术挑战点：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">1</span>）如何实现跨层级、综合各类型数据的收集和协同分析：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>问题往往跨越应用、<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Runtime</span>、内核和硬件多个层次，需要从异常现象沿调用链、数据流和控制流反向分析；</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">2</span>）如何以最小可观测性打点开销获得最大的诊断信息增益：增加的信息越多，系统运行开销和数据量也会随之增加，要求方案选择信息价值最高的观测点，避免全量打印、全路径打点等暴力方案；</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">四、期望达到的指标和效果：</span></u></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">参赛者给出通用的可观测性打点自动补全系统原型的设计方案和原型实现，支持给出问题案例的准确定位根因过程展示，并且具备扩展到其他<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>行为观测增强问题的能力。参赛者需要论证原型系统的计算开销、性能影响，牵引指标为新增可观测性打点<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DFX</span>数据量≤原有数据量<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">3%</span>，新增可观测性打点<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DFX</span>信息后关键性能指标劣化≤<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">3%</span>。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">五、测试用例</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">参考应用内存栈占用量统计拆解问题（见附录），决赛前将发布更多复杂的可观测性自驱完善问题。参赛队伍需要设计自动增加<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OpenHarmony</span>系统可观测性打点和功能的框架，准确提供类似<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OpenHarmony</span>应用内存栈占用等观测结果。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">六、参考文献：</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">不涉及。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">七、评选标准：</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 173%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">以给出的可观测性自驱增强问题为基础，参赛团队的解答方案给出的框架准确给出拆解结果。根据方案原型设计实现和效果演示，考察设计方案的定位准确性、功能通用性、可维护性等方面，以及推理计算开销成本和性能影响。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">附录：内存拆解发现<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>能力缺口的<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>可观测性增强<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">该案例依赖专家经验设计开发，本赛题期望演化为“<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">AI</span>自驱完成<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">”</span>类似<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>可观测性增强，并形成通用框架。此案例已在<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OpenHarmony</span>开源社区主干上落地，仅作为案例参考，帮助参赛者理解<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">OS</span>增强可观测性的作用和实现方式。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">1. </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">背景</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">终端<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> OS </span>出现内存增长时，先使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> `hidumper --mem &lt;pid&gt;` </span>对进程内存做一级拆解，判断增长来自<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> ArkTS Heap</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Native Heap</span>、匿名页、文件页、图形内存还是<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA</span>。此前只能回答“哪类内存在增长”。如果要继续定位根因，还需要回答“谁申请、是否释放、调用栈是什么”。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">另外，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DMA-BUF </span>还可能通过<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> `dup` </span>或<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> IPC </span>传递形成新的<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> FD </span>引用，因此完整生命周期不是简单的“申请—关闭”，而是“申请—复制<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>导入—逐引用关闭—最后释放”。</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">2. </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">拆解定位思路</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">hidumper </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">发现<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>增长</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">→ 尝试使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> HiProfiler </span>继续拆解</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">→ 发现<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> HiProfiler </span>不支持<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA</span></span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">→ 判定存在可观测性缺口<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">→ 补齐<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>采集与分析链路<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">3. DMA </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">可观测性需要补齐哪些能力</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">1</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DMA </span>事件源：感知<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>的真实申请、复制和释放</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">2</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）系统库<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/Hook </span>入口：把资源操作接入可观测性打点<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DFX </span>链路</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">3</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Native Hook</span>：采集事件和调用栈</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">HiProfiler </span>配置：控制是否启用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>采集</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">5</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Profiler </span>采集服务：处理采集数据</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">6</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Trace </span>解析与展示：将数据呈现给开发者</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">4. </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">主要修改：</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">third_party_musl/src/misc/ioctl.c</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">DMA </span>分配成功后上报分配事件</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">third_party_musl/src/unistd/dup.c</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">：记录新<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> FD</span>，并建立新旧<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> FD </span>或<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>对象之间的引用关系</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">third_party_musl/src/unistd/close.c: </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">检查并复用通用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> FD </span>关闭事件，作为一次<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>引用释放的入口</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">developtools_profiler/protos/types/plugins/native_hook: </span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">增加<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> DMA </span>采集配置和事件定义</span></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">developtools_profiler/device/plugins/native_hook</span></